      "text": "workflow:\n  rules:\n    - if: $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == \"merge_request_event\"\n      when: never\n    - when: always\n\nstages: [prep, build, test, deploy]\n\ndefault:\n  image: alpine:3.20\n  before_script:\n    - echo default-before\n\ninclude:\n  - local: /ci/base.yml\n  - \"ci/jobs/*.yml\"\n\nsetup:\n  stage: .pre\n  script: [echo setup]\n\ncleanup:\n  stage: .post\n  script: [echo cleanup]\n\ndeploy:\n  stage: deploy\n  extends: .deployable\n  script:\n    - !reference [.scripts, deploy-steps]\n  needs:\n    - job: \"test-matrix: [linux, x64]\"\n    - job: missing-job\n      optional: true\n  rules:\n    - if: $CI_COMMIT_TAG\n      when: manual\n\nbad-needs:\n  stage: build\n  script: [echo x]\n  needs: [deploy]\n\npages:\n  stage: deploy\n  script: [echo pages]\n  artifacts:\n    paths: [public]\n"
